<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns both secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns both secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has completed both credit auctions in the secondary market whereby it sought to inject 3.565 billion pesos.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERM	AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>1.365  bln pesos  4 days    31.68</p>
<p>2.200  bln pesos  1 day     31.61</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
